{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/dbn7lk2yx5it782tw5c7ft0jayjwrw9.mp3","text":"现在是我的值班时间。如果打扰到你办公了，我可以到外面待着。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/8u35ef8mo3njp1npuiarb50y9gp7eco.mp3","text":"你有好好调查过每位新加入干员的个人信息和情报吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/gqk905blgxj3lko5izbcaxzkln75kho.mp3","text":"只要战争仍在继续，就不会有什么地方是绝对安全的。这也同样适用于罗德岛，请你务必牢记这点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/7y43sx96ar46zemg90x1k6tw3ejlhjz.mp3","text":"坦白地说，你的周围混杂着许多人，不觉得这样其实很危险吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/gug2cfqvktebry8zmjnn0b0j9lexvgy.mp3","text":"居然有那么多和我一样的萨卡兹人来到了罗德岛，并且相互之间还能和睦相处，这确实让我很惊讶......","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/jdlteeqbf6r9lvf88ao5wd9g33nki2y.mp3","text":"我这把弩炮虽然不太容易操作，但威力绝不下于拉特兰人的铳。我将用它捍卫我族的荣耀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/jnhgc7tcfadrs7p8ysu5o3z463yhl57.mp3","text":"我见过守林人了。那个孩子，把我们并肩作战过的组织名当成自己的代号。也许那孩子的时间，在故乡被毁灭之时就已经停止了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/qactcbtk2s750abt7l86mv9l3sklkz3.mp3","text":"发生在我和守林人之间的那段过去，还是等她亲口告诉你吧......只能说，把叛军引向她故乡的人并不是我，只是......没人会相信一个萨卡兹人的话。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/rcp1fzwy8c83wfgv9pnzjf9ic95ycoc.mp3","text":"她有她的复仇，我有我的使命，既然如此，即使我们在这罗德岛重逢，或许依旧会走向各自的结局吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/1j9vrzzra37i0218f2jz81o8k76tia6.mp3","text":"哪里来的声音？难道是有谁在监视这个房间吗？还是说......只是我的错觉罢了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/hocy29jwys4cmrthi5mcc4nrxcduqwv.mp3","text":"代号陨星，职业是自由佣兵。如你所见，是萨卡兹人。即使这样，你还依然打算雇佣我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/qg86at3y5d1fn8im1lmuajo0p9j4erf.mp3","text":"瞄准技术提升了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/8cbense8uhrmd93616716cxhx9hnqpf.mp3","text":"想要提拔我吗？ 看来，选择在这儿工作，果然是对的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/7e27qu8b8gz3yyrwaawrkv1yzl4qoub.mp3","text":"这次，真的十分谢谢你。没想到，我这样的人，居然能在罗德岛获得如此稳定的一份工作。我会竭尽所能，回报你的信赖。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/bw9pch8kxbdo2la8iwov4ud1op98vq7.mp3","text":"我来了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/17utjwz3zeo7mtlj02gr65dat20b9cy.mp3","text":"要我做队长吗？严格来说，我不太擅长对别人发号施令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/8hmlg8wp3cz41b9ncej3yb91oa8l0bz.mp3","text":"我会好好照顾大家的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/9o8c4kucuhi9in9u4zyl1hn4y6g2r4v.mp3","text":"已经确认了敌情。各位，请做好战斗的准备。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/ofxnt2c50fjlqtmwwpepnzqmyszzkmf.mp3","text":"哦，好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/13yrz5bnwckzcfdbgx13q8ha5a8nhvh.mp3","text":"没问题。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/p27obw35tvycdt07v09zviidzzkmc5g.mp3","text":"视野良好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/dvmit0eo78dieb7191z994td53w46kh.mp3","text":"一口气解决他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/5djm0dvvpghnjel98z21yqkscrmhc5v.mp3","text":"射击。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/gevqbtmc7podu7ymh9bjf49iz86suxl.mp3","text":"开火。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/ssicca3sql56ol71ecr4gdt1lo5k314.mp3","text":"集中火力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/hshulpwvd406nmj208xg8y702jv5jqk.mp3","text":"退后！","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/0m1n6vewtic0w9ppplepal6pfgbyqbq.mp3","text":"我不想再看到熊熊燃烧的战火了，让一切，都结束吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/34l1netlgp24fqwyjjd4qh0xazsu6bk.mp3","text":"想从我布置完善的包围网中脱逃，真是异想天开。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/hkadaf5futgr8lzsbz8oh30crbotifr.mp3","text":"有人逃走了，现在还不能大意。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/p0m080lsoxtwpuwkp002n0jswkdjzbi.mp3","text":"撤退吧！回到据点，重整姿态。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/3kqodbsl4ajho98oa3dvqs1h49nwv06.mp3","text":"这里是什么地方？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/p2mcexy1igf0zmn4ys0awvfou9ea9bw.mp3","text":"呃！什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/9bmcu76jt1ei2l1eslayi98in1hexwe.mp3","text":"这个，是要送给我吗？啊，谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/h8rwkw14grtdlhl8d9hp9954prb752m.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/bhbus37v7zhyo0x30wunfpevvd6kw1t.mp3","text":"又过去了一年。作为雇佣兵来说，每多活一年，都算是值得高兴的事。但我不希望有更多人生活在这种不安中......博士，我为罗德岛上的孩子们准备了一点礼物，可以请您帮我分给他们吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/et0w4pn00lnox5w5bbw7ucprg815ql8.mp3","text":"博士，你好吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_219_meteo/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/oghnf1ioxmkc2iuktktc5mhuqnb6ilt.mp3","text":"现在是我的值班时间。如果打扰到你办公了，我可以到外面待着。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/d7c64jrkyu1pq8rs3g6yu62tmg6m73x.mp3","text":"你有好好调查过每位新加入干员的个人信息和情报吗？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/lnay1u0gf5kyohr4lmvsdgp7ix6qk4p.mp3","text":"只要战争仍在继续，就不会有什么地方是绝对安全的。这也同样适用于罗德岛，请你务必牢记这点。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/6mr7cf1terxrv3vq445eamtvr5nbmbd.mp3","text":"坦白地说，你的周围混杂着许多人，不觉得这样其实很危险吗？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/s5szl27gyv192equssxw9rkirppyfkr.mp3","text":"居然有那么多和我一样的萨卡兹人来到了罗德岛，并且相互之间还能和睦相处，这确实让我很惊讶......","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/qh8i074lvi6qi9xk7av04hdx6sdzsge.mp3","text":"我这把弩炮虽然不太容易操作，但威力绝不下于拉特兰人的铳。我将用它捍卫我族的荣耀。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/gk88ettuz61ceo9j9jgsackjlvbvzb2.mp3","text":"我见过守林人了。那个孩子，把我们并肩作战过的组织名当成自己的代号。也许那孩子的时间，在故乡被毁灭之时就已经停止了......","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/sxibm9e49ukuyv2rha0twzo5f20ptk9.mp3","text":"发生在我和守林人之间的那段过去，还是等她亲口告诉你吧......只能说，把叛军引向她故乡的人并不是我，只是......没人会相信一个萨卡兹人的话。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/5dfb05qn6b8dlbjuapwfk9p97et1e6u.mp3","text":"她有她的复仇，我有我的使命，既然如此，即使我们在这罗德岛重逢，或许依旧会走向各自的结局吧。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/87hdhf97pn4dx92b10yj6zglyh87ro5.mp3","text":"哪里来的声音？难道是有谁在监视这个房间吗？还是说......只是我的错觉罢了？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/m0w3kx1az7nd9id0qx7lcl9xy18d896.mp3","text":"代号陨星，职业是自由佣兵。如你所见，是萨卡兹人。即使这样，你还依然打算雇佣我吗？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/nmmoict577fsmfon9ucjgpxrhiyue0f.mp3","text":"瞄准技术提升了。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/8qqeq7v64q3w51a6t8ki89k0kxzncbe.mp3","text":"想要提拔我吗？ 看来，选择在这儿工作，果然是对的。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/guv8hkwwc8p4xjr8xv1q9p213k4kg06.mp3","text":"这次，真的十分谢谢你。没想到，我这样的人，居然能在罗德岛获得如此稳定的一份工作。我会竭尽所能，回报你的信赖。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/i81lyj5w60mjybfgdzbjxd9httzzmr3.mp3","text":"我来了。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/ar3d8m1puj85doydcq6nemcayg367r6.mp3","text":"要我做队长吗？严格来说，我不太擅长对别人发号施令。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/i15j4tuidhogzm4s7vlf6atvhx3y9ge.mp3","text":"我会好好照顾大家的。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/lomtdo8r7fldntvzak5l8sav6ug70cm.mp3","text":"已经确认了敌情。各位，请做好战斗的准备。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/4k4ktybo5prk7cgkac3x095ziqmmjwc.mp3","text":"哦，好。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/c36ioer0ysgod2tebljqe3mrr7x73oh.mp3","text":"没问题。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/qku73ej7sjxoegl79mopto68dzeuebw.mp3","text":"视野良好。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/4h6jn8dc7shwcfcm1h8537fiqnlbaua.mp3","text":"一口气解决他们。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/j3cxz4axsmpua4fkprk1fr9j2e3bqwa.mp3","text":"射击。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/63/8j4ocq4cfsj7m2wlpg376f8vweraje0.mp3","text":"开火。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/j87pl1i4owzirfvyts19rfg3zy6tabl.mp3","text":"集中火力。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/535krr45e6mg2kvhaygju1v1m99icmi.mp3","text":"退后！","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/lwqva4e3n2l143sz5s2nsz19pyu8uur.mp3","text":"我不想再看到熊熊燃烧的战火了，让一切，都结束吧。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/h02ckpbsge4wl0yqzwjk5ksdcnww73e.mp3","text":"想从我布置完善的包围网中脱逃，真是异想天开。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/a2xoynm7yfwytstxoxtp4379wwyx8py.mp3","text":"有人逃走了，现在还不能大意。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/chk1li9qrbrddqlyyrsmaivjvpwlmtt.mp3","text":"撤退吧！回到据点，重整姿态。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/kvzuv1074lszihdv9dmxd1mhj1xw9rv.mp3","text":"这里是什么地方？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/4niyfqu0gy4eek2gmq04ucowicvdsq2.mp3","text":"呃！什么？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/tch5cx0mh6yxw9383t6yysg7k0t6h37.mp3","text":"这个，是要送给我吗？啊，谢谢。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/j5cc0dw7g643dlwlolbfzcwsc7icjeb.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/4zmx8jwx86pi9g9ikk5h4srp675wva5.mp3","text":"又过去了一年。作为雇佣兵来说，每多活一年，都算是值得高兴的事。但我不希望有更多人生活在这种不安中......博士，我为罗德岛上的孩子们准备了一点礼物，可以请您帮我分给他们吗？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/q2xr9l5z4uefu01iisdsosca2iy0gn9.mp3","text":"博士，你好吗？","alt":"voice/char_219_meteo/cn_042.mp3"}]}}